1. Definitions

   "Software" means the source code, configuration, migrations, templates,
   styles, images, documentation and other materials of this repository,
   excluding the third-party components listed in Section 7.

   "Owner" means Vasiliy Nikolaevich Grishin.

2. Reservation of rights

   The Software is NOT open source and is not placed in the public domain.
   All exclusive rights are retained by the Owner and are protected by the
   copyright law of the Russian Federation and international treaties.
   Publishing the source code in a public repository does not grant any
   license.

3. Prohibited actions

   Without the Owner's prior written permission you may NOT:

   (a) reproduce, copy or store the Software or any part of it, except as
       expressly allowed by Section 4;
   (b) use the Software, including deploying or operating it in schools or
       any other organisation, commercially or non-commercially, or to
       provide services to third parties;
   (c) distribute, publish, transfer, rent, sell or sublicense the Software
       or any part of it;
   (d) modify the Software, create derivative works, or incorporate its
       code into other projects;
   (e) remove or alter any copyright notices.

4. Permitted use

   The Owner permits any person to:

   (a) view the source code for the purposes of reading, study and
       evaluation;
   (b) create forks and local copies through the repository hosting
       platform solely in order to read the code and prepare proposed
       changes (pull requests) for the Owner;
   (c) quote excerpts of the code in reviews, articles and discussions
       with attribution.

   Any other use requires a separate written agreement.

5. Contributions

   By submitting changes to this repository, the contributor grants the
   Owner a royalty-free, non-exclusive, perpetual, worldwide right to use,
   modify and distribute the contribution as part of the Software under any
   terms, including the terms of this license.

6. No warranty and limitation of liability

   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED FOR EVALUATION "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY
   KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING WARRANTIES OF FITNESS FOR A
   PARTICULAR PURPOSE, ABSENCE OF DEFECTS, SECURITY, DATA INTEGRITY AND
   NON-INFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE OWNER BE LIABLE FOR ANY DAMAGES,
   LOSS OF DATA OR OTHER HARM ARISING FROM THE SOFTWARE OR ITS USE.

7. Third-party components

   This repository includes third-party components distributed under their
   own terms and not covered by this license:

   - htmx (`lms/static/lms/vendor/htmx.min.js`) — Zero-Clause BSD, license
